    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/6/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_lochraster_4391f1bb0e.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Sturdy Tool Cradle",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Sturdy Tool Cradle</h3> <p>Tool cradles – can be universally fastened to the grid on the side walls and are suitable for complete tool sets of different sizes. Thanks to its load-bearing capacity, the »toolCart 750« can transport a total load of up to 250 kg despite its low weight. Thanks to assembly hook sets, important accessories such as an oil can or gloves can be securely secured to the flexible assembly grid.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/5/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_rahmen_88fd5333c1.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Flexible Applications",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Flexible Applications</h3> <p>Inserts – allow for the organized holding of complete tools of different sizes. Thanks to the Y-shape of the tool inserts, you can transport even more tools per frame in »the« »toolCart 750« in a space-saving manner, e.g., HSK 63.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/c/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_griff_f662d3dac9.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Ergonomic handle",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Ergonomic handle</h3> <p>Handle – an extremely sturdy and functional type of equipment for the »toolCart«. It allows tools and adapters to be transported safely and conveniently throughout the production facility.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
